{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53592","headline":"咏廿四气诗 霜降九月中 · 元稹","name":"咏廿四气诗 霜降九月中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风卷晴霜（一作「清云」）尽，空天万里霜。\n野豺先祭月，仙菊遇重阳。\n秋色悲疏木，鸿鸣忆故乡。\n谁知一罇酒，能使百秋亡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}